<h2>Questions</h2>
<details class="so-faq"><summary>Are tickets cheaper than face value?</summary><p>Not always. Seat Outlet is a resale marketplace, so prices are set by sellers and may be above or below face value.</p></details>
<details class="so-faq"><summary>When are prices usually best?</summary><p>There is no single rule. Prices can rise or fall as a date gets closer, so compare options on the event page and buy when a seat and price work for you.</p></details>
